Visibility: Complete visibility into request flows across complex distributed systems
Performance Optimization: Ability to identify bottlenecks and optimize service performance
Debugging: Faster troubleshooting of issues in production environments
Service Dependencies: Clear understanding of how services interact and depend on each other
Monitoring: Real-time insights into system health and performance
